==Strategy==
Treat this stage as you would [[Eldritch Forces]]; stall at the start for as long as possible, then overwhelm the boss with [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] debuffers. The only difference is that you must now be wary of Aku Doges, which may push through your stallers alongside the Mecha-Bun, however this problem can easily be solved by just using your general ranged attackers.

==Trivia==
*Unlike the original [[Eldritch Forces]], Infernal Forces lacks the [[No Continues]] restriction.

